# Keyboard Tester — Environment Variables
#
# This application does not currently require any environment variables
# to run. All keyboard testing, typing calculations, and statistics run
# entirely in the browser, and local history is stored in localStorage.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder in case future features (for example,
# an optional server-side leaderboard) introduce configuration values.
# If you add environment variables later, document them here and NEVER
# commit real secrets to version control.
